Since factory reset na ang FortiGate, ganito ang gawin:

1. Connect muna sa FortiGate

Kung default configuration pa siya, gamitin ang management interface at pumunta sa:

https://192.168.1.99

Sa PC mo, kailangan nasa same subnet:

IP Address:  192.168.1.10
Subnet Mask: 255.255.255.0
Gateway:     192.168.1.99

Then browser:

https://192.168.1.99
2. Pag nasa GUI na tayo

Doon na natin gagawin:

Network → Interfaces

At gagawa tayo ng VLAN interfaces:

VLAN10
VLAN20
VLAN30
VLAN40

Bawat isa may sariling:

VLAN ID
IP address
subnet mask
gateway

Then:

Network → DHCP Server

At gagawa tayo ng DHCP scope para sa bawat VLAN.

