Final result sa FortiGate

Dapat ganito ang makikita natin sa Network → Interfaces:

Interface	VLAN ID	IP/Netmask	Role
VLAN10	10	192.168.10.1/24	Gateway + DHCP
VLAN20	20	192.168.20.1/24	Gateway + DHCP
